8. Handle failures safely.

The model must not decide its own permissions.

Do not let the assistant execute arbitrary SQL, arbitrary code, arbitrary HTTP requests, or arbitrary database mutations.

Do not expose secrets or internal infrastructure information through tool results.

Require explicit confirmation before any consequential action.

