- Request timeout.
- Network failure.
- Malformed request.
- Empty user message.
- Invalid tool arguments.
- Unauthorized account access.
- Database unavailable.
- Conversation history unavailable.
- Stream interruption.
- Unexpected provider response.

Use friendly customer-facing messages.

